<h3 id="pop-for-subtle-emphasis">Pop for subtle emphasis</h3>
<p>When I make something appear or disappear on a slide, I want it to draw a little bit of attention to itself because I will be talking about that thing when that happens. A little bit of motion draws the eye of the audience and just makes the presentation feel a little more springy.</p>
